    "code": "void setup() {\n  Serial.begin(115200);\n  pinMode(18, OUTPUT); pinMode(19, INPUT);\n}\nvoid loop() {\n  digitalWrite(18, LOW); delayMicroseconds(2);\n  digitalWrite(18, HIGH); delayMicroseconds(10);\n  digitalWrite(18, LOW);\n  unsigned long echo = pulseIn(19, HIGH, 30000);\n  int percent = map(analogRead(34), 0, 4095, 0, 100);\n  Serial.print(\"Distance cm: \"); Serial.println(echo / 58.3);\n  Serial.print(\"Dial %: \"); Serial.println(percent);\n  delay(100);\n}\n",
